      "severity": "Important",
      "pass": "bugs",
      "problem": "`isAlmostLate` ignores `returnedAt`, so returned loans still get the due-soon email.",
      "reasoning": "`isOverdue` checks `!loan.returnedAt` (src/loans.js:39) but `isAlmostLate` does not, and `sendReminders` calls it for every loan in `db.loans` (src/reminders.js:8-12). Trigger: a copy returned early whose due date is two days away.",
      "impact": "Members who already brought a copy back get a \"Due soon\" email for it.",
      "fix": "Return false for a returned loan, as `isOverdue` does."
    },
    {
      "id": "F2",
