      },
      "severity": "Important",
      "pass": "bugs",
      "problem": "`isAlmostLate` is also true for overdue loans, so they get the due-soon email instead of the overdue reminder.",
      "reasoning": "`loan.dueDate - now <= 2 * 86_400_000` holds for any negative difference, and `sendReminders` `continue`s after the due-soon email, skipping the overdue branch. The existing test \"the first reminder goes out when the loan is already overdue\" fails at this commit.",
      "impact": "Overdue members are told their loan is due soon and never get the overdue reminder.",
      "fix": "Match only the day two days before the due date."
    },
