      "severity": "Minor",
      "pass": "standards",
      "problem": "`isAlmostLate` uses \"late\", a word GLOSSARY.md says to avoid for this concept.",
      "reasoning": "GLOSSARY.md, Overdue: \"_Avoid_: late, expired\". The new function's name and comment call a loan near its due date \"almost late\".",
      "impact": "The code drifts from the words the volunteers use; \"late\" reads as overdue.",
      "fix": "Name it for the due date, for example `isDueSoon`."
